{
  "description": "Export behaviour both apps share: which links survive, how HTML text is escaped, footnote ids, print geometry, and the plain-text projection of simple Markdown. Geometry is in points; content rectangle is reported as size only (macOS measures from the bottom-left, Windows from the top-left).",
